# Internal working files that must never reach this PUBLIC repo.
# A 1MB AI-session transcript was committed here once and, because git keeps
# every blob, stayed readable from history long after it was "deleted" --
# disclosing the production DB schema, secret names and rate-limit thresholds.
transcript*.txt
build_output.txt
*.env
*.env.*
!.env.example
*credentials*.json
